---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import BudgetTrail from '../components/BudgetTrail.astro'
---

<BaseLayout title="Budget, Step by Step" description="A short guide to set up and maintain a household budget with Actual Budget.">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <div class="page-shell home-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">A calm plan for your money</p>
        <h1>Make each dollar do one job.</h1>
        <p class="lede">This guide helps you set up and maintain a household budget in Actual Budget.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="/setup/">Set up your budget <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="/day-to-day/">See the daily routine</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-illustration" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="wallet-card card-back"><span>Future costs</span><b>$200</b></div>
        <div class="wallet-card card-front">
          <span>To Budget</span><b>$0</b>
          <i></i><i></i><i></i>
        </div>
        <div class="coin coin-one">$</div>
        <div class="coin coin-two">$</div>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 230 120"><path d="M7 109C48 45 89 135 126 67s76-42 97-56"/><circle cx="223" cy="11" r="7"/></svg>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="page-shell"><BudgetTrail /></div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-section page-shell" aria-labelledby="start-heading">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">The full process</p>
      <h2 id="start-heading">Start small. Keep going.</h2>
      <p>You do not need a perfect budget. You need a budget that you review.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lesson-grid">
      <a class="lesson-card tone-blue" href="/setup/"><span>1</span><h3>Set up</h3><p>Add your accounts and the money that you have now.</p><b>Start here →</b></a>
      <a class="lesson-card tone-yellow" href="/categories/"><span>2</span><h3>Choose categories</h3><p>Plan for regular bills and costs that come later.</p><b>Build your list →</b></a>
      <a class="lesson-card tone-coral" href="/day-to-day/"><span>3</span><h3>Review spending</h3><p>Import, check, and categorize each transaction.</p><b>Use the routine →</b></a>
      <a class="lesson-card tone-teal" href="/month-close/"><span>4</span><h3>Review the month</h3><p>Reconcile your accounts and prepare the next month.</p><b>Finish the month →</b></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="privacy-strip">
    <div class="page-shell privacy-inner">
      <span class="privacy-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
      <div><h2>Your numbers stay with you.</h2><p>This guide does not ask for account details or collect financial data. Checklist progress stays in this browser.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
